2026-01-30 17:45:13 | OUTPUT |     
2026-01-30 17:45:13 | OUTPUT |     While Joke 1 has a higher ceiling for cleverness, Joke 2 is more reliably funny and better adheres to the "economy" principle. Joke 1 risks being perceived as trying too hard, while Joke 2 is effortlessly amusing. Both are relevant to the headline, but Joke 2's simplicity gives it an edge.
